  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Intensifying military actions increase counterparty and settlement risk perceptions, causing banks and dealers to hoard high-quality collateral and withdraw from unsecured/secured short-term funding, tightening repo market liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">gulf_redsea_shipping</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_monetary_str</data>
