  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in kinetic and paramilitary operations in the Gulf/Red Sea compels the US and European allies to reallocate surveillance and naval assets and reduces political/military bandwidth for rapid reinforcement in Europe, which Russia can exploit to increase the tempo of missile, drone and frontline operations in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">gulf_redsea_shipping</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
