  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Intensified maritime military and paramilitary activity prompts insurers, equipment vendors and construction contractors to delay or suspend datacenter shipments and buildouts that rely on affected ports and logistics corridors, reducing near‑term compute expansion.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">gulf_redsea_shipping</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
