  <data key="d36">Higher intensity of military/paramilitary actions around shipping and energy infrastructure leads the US to expand non‑tariff tools (sanctions, licensing restrictions, export controls and vetting requirements) against implicated actors and supply channels.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
