  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher rates of attacks on commercial shipping raise insurance costs, force port closures and convoy requirements and produce routing delays that disrupt and reduce the volume of Western arms shipments transiting Mediterranean/Suez corridors destined for Ukraine.</data>
