  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in benchmark oil prices driven by Gulf/Red Sea disruptions raise Russian hydrocarbon revenues and foreign-currency availability, enabling expanded procurement, production and export of advanced strike systems (missiles, armed drones) and thereby increasing their proliferation rate into the conflict theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
