  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A faster rate of production and distribution of long‑range cruise missiles and armed drones increases the availability of precision strike systems that state sponsors and proxies (e.g., Iran and Houthi-aligned groups) can use to hit commercial vessels, raising the frequency of attacks in the Red Sea and Gulf.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
