  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid diffusion and battlefield use of advanced strike/autonomous systems generates high‑visibility incidents and export/reexport concerns that prompt US and allied regulators to expand oversight, testing and export controls on dual‑use AI and guidance technologies.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
</edge>
