  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster spread of advanced strike systems raises demand to deny critical components and technology, prompting the U.S. to expand licensing requirements, end‑use controls and product‑specific bans (non‑tariff measures) on dual‑use electronics and propulsion components.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_economic_statecraft</data>
