  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in cross‑border weapons shipments (especially from actors outside Western coalitions) triggers rapid U.S. countermeasures — new sanctions, secondary penalties and export controls — increasing the rate at which economic policy escalations are introduced.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
