  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster improvement in AI capabilities raises operational effectiveness of ISR, targeting and autonomous strike systems, which increases demand and incentives to ramp production, strengthening the self‑reinforcing proliferation-feedback loop.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
