  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid, observable gains in AI capabilities create strategic and economic alarms that prompt policymakers to introduce new export controls, investment reviews and countermeasures at a faster cadence.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">us_economic_statecraft</data>
