  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute shortages of chips and memory depress manufacturing output and freight activity in major importers (notably China), lowering near-term fuel and industrial oil demand and putting downward pressure on benchmark crude prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">gulf_redsea_shipping</data>
