  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter supply/export controls or shortages of specialized chips used in seekers, guidance and drone control directly reduce the pace at which advanced strike systems can be produced and fielded, lowering their proliferation rate.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
