  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter availability of specialized chips and high‑bandwidth memory causes immediate production stoppages, order cancellations and urgent supplier switching that increases interruptions and lead times in intermediate‑goods flows.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">us_economic_statecraft</data>
