  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Direct export controls, licensing requirements and product bans on semiconductor parts and fabrication equipment immediately block or delay shipments and approvals, creating acute bottlenecks in specialized chip and memory supply.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_economic_statecraft</data>
