  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A faster pace of new trade measures and countermeasures prompts regulators and security agencies to expand oversight, tighten export controls and increase review requirements for cross‑border AI R&amp;D and technology transfers.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_economic_statecraft</data>
