  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Disruptions to critical component flows (chips, guidance units, sensors, engines) caused by targeted export curbs and sanctions slow domestic and subcontractor production lines, directly lowering the rate at which advanced strike systems are produced, distributed, and fielded.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_economic_statecraft</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
