  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Interruptions to component availability, port congestion and increased lead times directly delay procurement and deployment of accelerators and related data‑center hardware, reducing total usable compute infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_economic_statecraft</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
</edge>
