  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Changes in bilateral trade directly alter trade-related FX settlements, trade finance activity and corporate cash-management flows, which translate into corresponding net portfolio and debt flows across borders.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_economic_statecraft</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_monetary_str</data>
</edge>
