  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained decline in bilateral trade (e.g., between the US and a major trading partner) lowers container and tanker demand that transits Suez/Red Sea, thereby reducing overall shipping traffic through those corridors.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
